  "id": "section-35016",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "35016001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "风虎云龙",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35016002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "啊哦，一不小心打翻了黑色的颜料盒……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35016003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "出现了，是黑色的大喵喵！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35016004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "贝歌",
          "text": "居然有一种别样的生动之感。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35016005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "黑色的喵喵最可爱啦，米菲亚好喜欢~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35016006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "塞西尔",
          "text": "我得承认，优纪完成的所有作品里，我最中意这个。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35016007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "米菲亚",
          "text": "喵喵喵，米菲亚什么时候可以骑着大黑喵出去玩？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35016008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "一次失误竟然得到了大家的肯定，优纪都不知道应不应该开心呢……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "35016009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "兔儿爷",
          "text": "恭喜优纪，是件值得高兴的事哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
